        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Opens the chapter on national context by making the case for eHealth as central to responsive health systems and giving WHO's definition of eHealth as the use of ICT for health. It describes how eHealth supports care delivery, workforce, programme management and research. It notes international commitments to eHealth and the need for national strategies to coordinate efforts.",
