      "content": "method\nThe Toolkit method is based on experience and lessons from countries that have already \ndeveloped a national strategy (Figure 4). A successful outcome requires effective leadership, a \nwell-managed process and stakeholder engagement. The vision is developed through an iterative \napproach, which ensures it is grounded in the current context, yet is not overly constrained.\nFirst, an initial ‘unconstrained’ vision is drafted, based on a review of health system goals, \nchallenges and relevant international trends and best practices. Next, the vision is refined, \nbased on an analysis of the",
