      "content": "Annex C. Mapping eHealth components to action lines » page 53\nAnnex C\nMapping eHealth components to action \nlines\nThis Annex shows how the eHealth action lines introduced in Chapter 5 relate to the national \neHealth component map provided in Part 1 of the Toolkit. The component map has been split \nacross two pages for readability (Figure 12).\nFigure 12. Mapping eHealth components to action lines \nLeadership and governance\nLeadership and governance mechanisms\nStrategy and \ninvestment\nServices and applications\nHealth-care service delivery tools\nHealth-care communications and collaboration \nIndiv",
