      "content": "Annex E. Examples of eHealth activity risks » page 60\nAnnex E \nExamples of eHealth activity risks\nThis Annex provides additional information regarding the potential risks that may be associated \nwith the activities within the action plan. This is not intended to be an exhaustive list of risks \nbut rather a means to assist readers in understanding common areas of risks that should be \nexplored.\nLeadership and governance risks\nThis area encompasses those risks that may have an impact on the ability to deliver effective \nleadership and governance of the eHealth action plan (Table 21). \nTable 21.",
