      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Chapter 1 sets out the elements of a monitoring and evaluation framework for a national eHealth programme: indicators, baseline and target measures, and governance and processes. It explains that output indicators show eHealth adoption while outcome indicators show results, that targets should cover several timeframes, and that national governance oversees the work and triggers timely intervention when progress diverges from aims.",
